backend/database/*.db
*.db.bak-*

# Design reference for the v2 rebuild — 25 MB of screenshots of a third-party app.
# This repo is public, so they stay local. docs/v2/SPEC.md is the committed,
# authoritative distillation of them; no session needs the images.
inspiration/

